{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DjobaDELATV/seygo_data/main/schema/v1/card.json",
  "id": "c6970f71-1563-4f5c-a6a2-739814afaae0",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Goyo Chaser",
      "effect": "1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\nThis card gains 300 ATK for each EARTH Warrior-Type Synchro Monster on the field (other than this card). When this card destroys an opponent's monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard: You can Special Summon that monster to your side of the field, but its ATK becomes halved."
    },
    "fr": {
      "name": "Poursuivant Goyo",
      "effect": "1 Syntoniseur + 1 monstre non-Syntoniseur ou plus\nCette carte gagne 300 ATK pour chaque Monstre Synchro TERRE de Type Guerrier sur le Terrain (cette carte exclue). Lorsque cette carte d\u00e9truit un monstre de votre adversaire au combat et l'envoie au Cimeti\u00e8re : vous pouvez Invoquer Sp\u00e9cialement le monstre sur votre Terrain, mais son ATK sera divis\u00e9e par deux."
    },
    "de": {
      "name": "Goyoverfolger",
      "effect": "1 Empf\u00e4nger- + 1 oder mehr Nicht-Empf\u00e4nger-Monster\nDiese Karte erh\u00e4lt 300 ATK f\u00fcr jedes ERDE Synchromonster vom Typ Krieger auf dem Spielfeld (au\u00dfer dieser Karte). Wenn diese Karte ein Monster deines Gegners durch Kampf zerst\u00f6rt und auf den Friedhof legt: Du kannst das Monster als Spezialbeschw\u00f6rung auf deine Spielfeldseite beschw\u00f6ren, aber seine ATK werden halbiert."
    },
    "it": {
      "name": "Inseguitore Goyo",
      "effect": "1 Tuner + 1 o pi\u00f9 mostri non-Tuner\nQuesta carta guadagna 300 ATK per ogni Mostro Synchro TERRA di Tipo Guerriero sul Terreno (diverso da questa carta). Quando questa carta distrugge un mostro dell'avversario in battaglia e lo manda al Cimitero: puoi Evocare Specialmente quel mostro sul tuo Terreno, ma il suo ATK diventa la met\u00e0."
    },
    "pt": {
      "name": "Perseguidor Goyo",
      "effect": "1 Regulador + 1 ou mais monstros n\u00e3o-Reguladores\nEste card ganha 300 de ATK para cada Monstro Sincro de TERRA do Tipo Guerreiro no campo (que n\u00e3o seja este card). Quando este card destruir um monstro do oponente em batalha e envi\u00e1-lo para o Cemit\u00e9rio: voc\u00ea pode Invocar esse monstro por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Especial no seu lado do campo, mas o ATK dele \u00e9 reduzido \u00e0 metade."
    },
    "es": {
      "name": "Perseguidor Goyo",
      "effect": "1 Cantante + 1 o m\u00e1s monstruos que no sean Cantantes\nEsta carta gana 300 ATK por cada Monstruo de Sincron\u00eda de TIERRA de Tipo Guerrero en el campo (que no sea esta carta). Cuando esta carta destruye un monstruo de tu adversario en batalla y lo manda al Cementerio: puedes Invocar a ese monstruo de Modo Especial a tu lado del Campo, pero su ATK se reduce a la mitad."
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "\u30b4\u30e8\u30a6\u30fb\u30c1\u30a7\u30a4\u30b5\u30fc",
      "effect": "\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30ca\u30fc\uff0b\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30ca\u30fc\u4ee5\u5916\u306e\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\uff11\u4f53\u4ee5\u4e0a\n\u2460\uff1a\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u653b\u6483\u529b\u306f\u3001\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u4ee5\u5916\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u306e\u6226\u58eb\u65cf\u30fb\u5730\u5c5e\u6027\u306e\uff33\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u6570\u00d7\uff13\uff10\uff10\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u3059\u308b\u3002\u2461\uff1a\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u304c\u6226\u95d8\u3067\u76f8\u624b\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u7834\u58ca\u3057\u5893\u5730\u3078\u9001\u3063\u305f\u6642\u306b\u767a\u52d5\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3002\u305d\u306e\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u653b\u6483\u529b\u3092\u534a\u5206\u306b\u3057\u3066\u81ea\u5206\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u306b\u7279\u6b8a\u53ec\u559a\u3059\u308b\u3002"
    },
    "ko": {
      "name": "\uace0\uc694\uc6b0 \uccb4\uc774\uc11c",
      "effect": "\ud29c\ub108 + \ud29c\ub108 \uc774\uc678\uc758 \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130 1\uc7a5 \uc774\uc0c1\n\u2460: \uc774 \uce74\ub4dc\uc758 \uacf5\uaca9\ub825\uc740, \uc774 \uce74\ub4dc \uc774\uc678\uc758 \ud544\ub4dc\uc758 \uc804\uc0ac\uc871 / \ub545 \uc18d\uc131\uc758 \uc2f1\ud06c\ub85c \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\uc758 \uc218 \u00d7 300 \uc62c\ub9b0\ub2e4. \u2461: \uc774 \uce74\ub4dc\uac00 \uc804\ud22c\ub85c \uc0c1\ub300 \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\ub97c \ud30c\uad34\ud558\uace0 \ubb18\uc9c0\ub85c \ubcf4\ub0c8\uc744 \ub54c\uc5d0 \ubc1c\ub3d9\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub2e4. \uadf8 \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\uc758 \uacf5\uaca9\ub825\uc744 \uc808\ubc18\uc73c\ub85c \ud558\uace0 \uc790\uc2e0 \ud544\ub4dc\uc5d0 \ud2b9\uc218 \uc18c\ud658\ud55c\ub2e4."
    }
